@step:CT-NMP-SSRS-Console.1007/default.py
Feature: Rerun - Repeat Scan

  Scenario: Repeat an axial scan
    When a patient is registered with the following information:
      | Patient ID | Last Name | scan type |
      | 1001 | Repeat | Axial |
    When an axial scan is completed and "Repeat" is performed
    Then the following parameters should remain the same between the two scans:
      | Parameter1 | Parameter2 | Parameter3 | Parameter4 | Parameter5 |
      | Length | Collimation | Cycles | kV | mAs |
    Then the patient should contain two axial series: one original axial series and one generated by the repeat scan.
